      "body": "### 介绍：\n\n**AI Elements Vue** 是一个基于 shadcn-vue 构建的组件库，可帮助您更快地构建原生 AI 应用程序。\n\n> 随着越来越多的网站集成 AI，开发者亟需专业组件库来快速落地；即便交互形态从 Chat 演进到 Agents 与 Workflows，Chat 依旧是不可替代的核心入口。然而当下的 AI 组件生态仍主要依赖传统组件库（如 Ant Design X），而 AI Elements Vue 基于 Shadcn Vue，支持高度定制，让开发者真正掌控代码。\n\n### 开源地址：\n\nhttps://github.com/cwandev/ai-elements-vue\n\n### 预览地址：\n\nhttps://www.ai-elements-vue.com\n\n### 部分组件截图：\n\n**Actions**\n<img width=\"782\" height=\"314\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b29ee447-b09d-4528-9b4c-d4a975eb0100\" />\n\n**Branch**\n<img width=\"788\" height=\"324\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/714885dd-a2a9-423a-bbb7-3ab567b97b00\" />\n\n**Chain of Thought**\n<img width=\"789\" height=\"537\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b3ff3ee-f9df-4144-9041-5fa646f4c011\" />\n\n**PromptInput**\n<img width=\"788\" height=\"197\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05f6998b-69d5-463d-a5be-4912dd4a85f1\" />\n\n**Queued**\n<img width=\"795\" height=\"503\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1efc029a-0c9c-4d28-b4bc-67686e3d4992\" />\n\n**Response**\n<img width=\"788\" height=\"582\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e00b8ad-f27a-4aae-bb16-b7d80455aa14\" />\n\n**Shimmer**\n<img width=\"786\" height=\"167\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e95b1a0e-aab7-4422-bff2-a0bd8ce609f1\" />\n\n**Sources**\n<img width=\"788\" height=\"193\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc161197-c3af-4708-8589-0702300c0feb\" />\n\n**Task**\n<img width=\"792\" height=\"281\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a79875c3-f1f1-4b61-8c68-4c91f1b25aff\" />",
